firewall enable
Firewall default permit
acl number 3003
rule 0 permit tcp
rule 5 permit icmp
acl number 2003
rule 0 deny source 192.168.0.0 0.0.0.255
Interface GigabitEthernet0/0
firewall packet-filter 3003 inbound
firewall packet-filter 2003 outbound
ipaddress 192.168.0.1 255.255.255.0
